gnome-shell-extension-transparent-top-bar (2.0.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Connect window-actor listeners only while dark-full-screen is enabled.
  * Apply panel opacity via a scoped inline style preserving sibling styles
    and drop the 101-class stylesheet rules.
  * Read precomputed panel luminance sidecars when present and cache
    measurements across identical wallpaper contexts.

